<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns:m='http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Modul_P1_Matematika_Kelas_III_Kalimat_Matematika</title><style>
